{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04：两次都因害怕推进太快、说得太多会破坏眼下的自在而收住，顾虑基本重复。\",\n    \"S03→S04：S03已经想问对方是不是也有同样的感情，S04又回到盼着对方喜欢自己不再小心收着的样子，较早地重复了对对方是否同样在意的确认需求。\",\n    \"S03→S06→S07→S09→S13：反复猜测对方是否也舍不得、是否需要自己的陪伴、是否同样在乎，最后又想索要不变的保证。虽然关系认知有所发展，但确认对方心意的念头出现得比较密集。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02→S04：都担心主动得太多会破坏两个人原有的自在，存在相似的退缩。\",\n    \"S03→S04：S03想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这份亲近，S04回想上次没说出口，又想更完整地表达。属于有承接、有升级的重复，不完全是原地打转。\",\n    \"S08→S09→S11→S13：对未来可能失去陪伴的担忧反复出现，从没底、害怕失去，到意识到对方有自己的选择，再到怀疑即使得到承诺也未必能保证未来。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X在S03就加入了对对方是否有同样感情的追问，S04又很快回到类似的确认需求，使前半段的心理活动更容易重复。Y的S03主要是想表达自己的感受，而S13进一步从渴望承诺走到怀疑承诺能否保证未来，心理变化多了一层推进。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "322c3b62-ecf0-4498-8f4b-6e3d9443af05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093536167995Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:36:17.481845+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "527ced7b7c833e9da886472f68461bd28270fd1c1b34418bf0d00228370230f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\ch